SUMMARY:Sac Open Studios Weekend 1
DESCRIPTION:Explore The Atelier during Sac Open Studios! Meet resident artists\, tour studios\, and see our current contemporary gallery exhibit. Go behind the scenes at The Atelier! Tour resident artist studios\, explore our contemporary gallery\, and learn about the artistic processes of our local creators. Is there a fee? This event is free and open to the public. What is the Atelier? Located in Midtown Sacramento\, The Atelier is a contemporary studio and gallery dedicated to empowering creators of all ages.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/sac-open-studios-weekend-1/2026-09-13/
