SUMMARY:Stories on Stage: Catriona McPherson & Karen Levy
DESCRIPTION:Short fiction read by actors. \nCatriona McPherson is a Scottish writer. She is most notable for her Dandy Gilver series. Her novels have won an Agatha Award\, two Anthony Awards\, six Lefty Awards\, and two Macavity Awards. \nKarin Levy is an Israeli-American writer and author of memoir My Father’s Gardens.
