SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:🧘‍♀️ Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard 🌿\nTuesday\, September 15 | 5:45–6:45 PM\nTicket Includes: Yoga Class\nStart your week with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views!\nJoin us for a relaxing outdoor yoga class designed for all experience levels\, especially those new to yoga. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement in a welcoming\, supportive setting.\nSurrounded by our organic vineyard\, wildflowers\, and peaceful morning scenery\, it’s the perfect way to stretch\, breathe\, and ease into your week.\nWhat to Bring:\n• Yoga mat\n• Towel\n• Water\nCome stretch\, breathe\, and start your week the Great Bear way!
