SUMMARY:University Farm Circle Newcomers Welcome
DESCRIPTION:University Farm Circle ( UFC) is a philanthropic\, educational and social programs organization. UFC invites all Yolo County and surrounding area residents to our annual Newcomers Welcome on Wednesday\, September 16th\, from 9:30 to 11:30 AM at the Unitarian Universalist Church 27074 Patwin Road\, Davis CA.\nAt the UFC Newcomers Welcome you’ll meet like-minded people looking to foster new friendships\, experiences and hear more about what UFC has to offer.\nThere will be a short presentation by Board Members to familiarize you with all UFC has to offer an answer any questions you may have.\nYou will also explore and sign up for our diverse array of special interest groups. UFC offers more than 60 groups – everything from wine tasting\, book groups\, mahjong\, pickleball\, paddle boarding\, foreign language and lunch groups.\nLight refreshments will be provided.\nFor more information and registration by September 15th\, check the online calendar www.ufcdavis.org.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/university-farm-circle-newcomers-welcome/
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Church of Davis\, 27074 Patwin Rd\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_3380.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="University Farm Circle":MAILTO:info@ufcdavis.org
END:VEVENT
